#: data/maps/MeteorFalls_1F_2R/scripts.inc:63
msgctxt "MeteorFalls_1F_2R_Text_NicolasIntro"
msgid ""
"This is where we DRAGON users do our\n"
"training.\p"
"The CHAMPION even visits.\n"
"Now do you see how special it is here?$"
msgstr ""
"这里是我们这些使用龙宝可梦的\n"
"人修行的地方。\p"
"就连冠军都会来这里。\n"
"现在你知道这里有多特别了吧？$"

#: data/maps/MeteorFalls_1F_2R/scripts.inc:69
msgctxt "MeteorFalls_1F_2R_Text_NicolasDefeat"
msgid ""
"Urgh!\n"
"I didn't expect you to be so strong!$"
msgstr "呜！没想到你这么强！$"

#: data/maps/MeteorFalls_1F_2R/scripts.inc:73
msgctxt "MeteorFalls_1F_2R_Text_NicolasPostBattle"
msgid ""
"The road ahead remains long and harsh.\p"
"When will my POKéMON and I become\n"
"the best?$"
msgstr ""
"前方的道路依然漫长而艰险。\p"
"我和我的宝可梦什么时\n"
"候才能成为最强呢？$"

#: data/maps/MeteorFalls_1F_2R/scripts.inc:78
msgctxt "MeteorFalls_1F_2R_Text_NicolasRegister"
msgid ""
"I want to know more about your power.\n"
"Let me register you in my POKéNAV.$"
msgstr ""
"我想更了解你的实力。\n"
"让我把你登记到我的宝可梦导航里吧。$"

#: data/maps/MeteorFalls_1F_2R/scripts.inc:82
msgctxt "MeteorFalls_1F_2R_Text_NicolasRematchIntro"
msgid ""
"Since we met, we have trained hard\n"
"with our sights on number one.\p"
"Help us see how much stronger we've\n"
"become!$"
msgstr ""
"自从我们相遇以后，\n"
"我们就以第一为目标刻苦修行。\p"
"让我们看看我们变强了多少吧！$"

#: data/maps/MeteorFalls_1F_2R/scripts.inc:88
msgctxt "MeteorFalls_1F_2R_Text_NicolasRematchDefeat"
msgid ""
"Urgh!\n"
"I didn't expect you to be so strong!$"
msgstr "呜！没想到你这么强！$"

#: data/maps/MeteorFalls_1F_2R/scripts.inc:92
msgctxt "MeteorFalls_1F_2R_Text_NicolasPostRematch"
msgid ""
"You've obviously kept up your\n"
"POKéMON training.\p"
"So long as you remain strong, I, too,\n"
"can become stronger!$"
msgstr ""
"看得出来，你一直在坚持培养宝可梦。\p"
"只要你一直强大下去，我也能变得更强！$"

#: data/maps/MeteorFalls_1F_2R/scripts.inc:98
msgctxt "MeteorFalls_1F_2R_Text_JohnIntro"
msgid ""
"JOHN: We've always battled POKéMON\n"
"together as a twosome.\l"
"We've confidence in ourselves.$"
msgstr ""
"阿约：我们一直都是两个人一起进行宝\n"
"可梦对战的。我们对自己很有信心。$"

#: data/maps/MeteorFalls_1F_2R/scripts.inc:103
msgctxt "MeteorFalls_1F_2R_Text_JohnDefeat"
msgid ""
"JOHN: Oh, my.\n"
"We've lost, dear wife.$"
msgstr "阿约：哎呀，我们输了，亲爱的老伴。$"

#: data/maps/MeteorFalls_1F_2R/scripts.inc:107
msgctxt "MeteorFalls_1F_2R_Text_JohnPostBattle"
msgid ""
"JOHN: We've been married for\n"
"fifty years.\p"
"Come to think of it, I've yet to beat\n"
"my dear wife in a battle.$"
msgstr ""
"阿约：我们结婚已经五十年了。\p"
"说起来，我在对战中还\n"
"从来没赢过我亲爱的老伴呢。$"

#: data/maps/MeteorFalls_1F_2R/scripts.inc:113
msgctxt "MeteorFalls_1F_2R_Text_JohnNotEnoughMons"
msgid ""
"JOHN: Well, well, what a young TRAINER!\p"
"Will you battle with us? If so, you'll\n"
"have to return with more POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""
"阿约：哎呀呀，好年轻的训练家！\p"
"要和我们对战吗？如果要的话，\n"
"你得带更多的宝可梦再来。$"

#: data/maps/MeteorFalls_1F_2R/scripts.inc:118
msgctxt "MeteorFalls_1F_2R_Text_JohnRegister"
msgid ""
"JOHN: Young TRAINER, if the chance\n"
"arises, will you battle with us again?$"
msgstr ""
"阿约：年轻的训练家，如果有机会的话，\n"
"你愿意再和我们对战吗？$"

#: data/maps/MeteorFalls_1F_2R/scripts.inc:122
msgctxt "MeteorFalls_1F_2R_Text_JayIntro"
msgid ""
"JAY: We've been married for\n"
"fifty years.\p"
"The bond we share as a couple could\n"
"never be broken.$"
msgstr ""
"阿洁：我们结婚已经五十年了。\p"
"我们夫妻之间的羁绊是永远不会断的。$"

#: data/maps/MeteorFalls_1F_2R/scripts.inc:128
msgctxt "MeteorFalls_1F_2R_Text_JayDefeat"
msgid ""
"JAY: Oh, dear.\n"
"We've lost, my dear husband.$"
msgstr "阿洁：哎呀。我们输了，亲爱的老伴。$"

#: data/maps/MeteorFalls_1F_2R/scripts.inc:132
msgctxt "MeteorFalls_1F_2R_Text_JayPostBattle"
msgid ""
"JAY: Fifty years of marriage…\p"
"If we ever argued, we always settled\n"
"it with a POKéMON battle…$"
msgstr ""
"阿洁：结婚五十年……\p"
"每次吵架，\n"
"我们都是用宝可梦对战来解决的……$"

#: data/maps/MeteorFalls_1F_2R/scripts.inc:137
msgctxt "MeteorFalls_1F_2R_Text_JayNotEnoughMons"
msgid ""
"JAY: Well, well, aren't you a young\n"
"TRAINER?\p"
"If you'd care to battle with us, you'll\n"
"have to come back with more POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""
"阿洁：哎呀呀，你是位年轻的训练家吧？\p"
"如果想和我们对战，\n"
"你得带更多的宝可梦再来。$"

#: data/maps/MeteorFalls_1F_2R/scripts.inc:143
msgctxt "MeteorFalls_1F_2R_Text_JohnRematchIntro"
msgid ""
"JOHN: We've always battled POKéMON\n"
"together as a twosome.\l"
"We've confidence in ourselves.$"
msgstr ""
"阿约：我们一直都是两个人一起进行宝\n"
"可梦对战的。我们对自己很有信心。$"

#: data/maps/MeteorFalls_1F_2R/scripts.inc:148
msgctxt "MeteorFalls_1F_2R_Text_JohnRematchDefeat"
msgid ""
