"We've lost, dear wife.$"
msgstr "阿约：哎呀，我们输了，亲爱的老伴。$"

#: data/maps/MeteorFalls_1F_2R/scripts.inc:152
msgctxt "MeteorFalls_1F_2R_Text_JohnPostRematch"
msgid ""
"JOHN: Married for fifty years…\p"
"On reflection, the dear wife and I,\n"
"we battled day in and day out…$"
msgstr ""
"阿约：结婚五十年……\p"
"回想起来，\n"
"我和亲爱的老伴每天都在对战……$"

#: data/maps/MeteorFalls_1F_2R/scripts.inc:157
msgctxt "MeteorFalls_1F_2R_Text_JohnRematchNotEnoughMons"
msgid ""
"JOHN: Well, well, what a young TRAINER!\p"
"Will you battle with us? If so, you'll\n"
"have to return with more POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""
"阿约：哎呀呀，好年轻的训练家！\p"
"要和我们对战吗？如果要的话，\n"
"你得带更多的宝可梦再来。$"

#: data/maps/MeteorFalls_1F_2R/scripts.inc:162
msgctxt "MeteorFalls_1F_2R_Text_JayRematchIntro"
msgid ""
"JAY: We've been married for\n"
"fifty years.\p"
"We've supported each other all that\n"
"time. We've made ourselves strong.$"
msgstr ""
"阿洁：我们结婚已经五十年了。\p"
"这么多年来我们一直互相扶持。\n"
"我们让彼此变得更强了。$"

#: data/maps/MeteorFalls_1F_2R/scripts.inc:168
msgctxt "MeteorFalls_1F_2R_Text_JayRematchDefeat"
msgid ""
"JAY: Oh, dear.\n"
"We've lost, my dear husband.$"
msgstr "阿洁：哎呀。我们输了，亲爱的老伴。$"

#: data/maps/MeteorFalls_1F_2R/scripts.inc:172
msgctxt "MeteorFalls_1F_2R_Text_JayPostRematch"
msgid ""
"JAY: Fifty years of marriage…\n"
"Many things have happened.\p"
"I hope that we will continue to make\n"
"happy memories together.$"
msgstr ""
"阿洁：结婚五十年……\n"
"发生过很多很多事。\p"
"希望我们今后也\n"
"能继续一起创造幸福的回忆。$"

#: data/maps/MeteorFalls_1F_2R/scripts.inc:178
msgctxt "MeteorFalls_1F_2R_Text_JayRematchNotEnoughMons"
msgid ""
"JAY: Well, well, aren't you a young\n"
